{"seq":2,"slug":"multicurrency-fx-conversion","title":"多币种结算、汇率锁定与打款币种选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-payout-global-disbursement-remittance-ops/payable-settlement-model/multicurrency-fx-conversion","wordCount":3250,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"多币种结算-汇率锁定与打款币种选择\">多币种结算、汇率锁定与打款币种选择</h1><p>一笔跨境订单从买家付款到卖家银行账户入账，中间穿过三种不同的币种定义：<strong>计价币种</strong>（买家看到的价格）、<strong>记账币种</strong>（平台账本与卖家余额的单位）、<strong>打款币种</strong>（最终打到卖家收款账户的货币）。三者若被混为一谈，账本上就会出现无法解释的在途差额。本文只处理这一层——多币种下应付结算的币种模型、汇率从哪来、锁多久、以及该按哪个币种出款。同章目录见 <a href=\"./\">本册索引</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-计价币-记账币-出款币三层模型\">核心概念：计价币、记账币、出款币三层模型</h2><p>把「一笔钱是什么币种」拆成三层，是跨境应付系统的第一个设计决策，也最容易被省掉。省掉它的代价是：卖家的「可提现余额」是一个数字，但它究竟代表多少人民币谁也说不清。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>谁决定</th>\n<th>会计含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计价币种（presentment）</td>\n<td>买家下单时看到的货币</td>\n<td>商城本地化策略</td>\n<td>不是账本事实，只是对外展示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记账币种（book / functional）</td>\n<td>平台账本与卖家子账户的单位</td>\n<td>平台会计政策</td>\n<td>会计分录的记账本位币</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出款币种（payout）</td>\n<td>实际打到卖家收款账户的货币</td>\n<td>卖家选择 + 通道能力</td>\n<td>触发一次显式汇兑与出账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键规则是：<strong>余额必须按记账币种持有，转入出款币种时必须走一笔显式的汇兑交易</strong>，而不是在出款时偷偷乘以一个汇率。前一章已确立「余额是缓存、分录是真相」，跨币种结算要在此基础上再加一条不变量——每个（账户 × 币种）独立成户，10 美元和 900 日元相加没有会计意义。因此汇兑必须被记成看得见的分录：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>出账</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>币种</mtext><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>入账</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>币种</mtext><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>点差收入</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{出账}(币种A, -a) + \\text{入账}(币种B, +b) + \\text{点差收入}(-\\epsilon) = 0, \\quad \\epsilon = a \\cdot r - b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">出账</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">币种</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">入账</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">币种</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">点差收入</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 是这笔汇兑产生的价差收入。把它记成收入分录，汇兑损益才会随时间自然累积到损益表，而不是藏在代码里的浮点误差。ISO 4217 为每个币种定义最小单位（minor unit exponent）：日元为 0（没有「分」），科威特第纳尔为 3，绝大多数为 2（来源：ISO 4217 货币代码标准 <a href=\"https://www.iso.org/iso-4217-currency-codes.html\">https://www.iso.org/iso-4217-currency-codes.html</a>）。所有金额在账本里以整数最小单位存储，只在跨币种换算时引入小数与舍入规则。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[买家支付&lt;br/&gt;计价币 USD] --&gt; B{平台账本&lt;br/&gt;记账币?}&#10;    B --&gt; C[卖家子账户&lt;br/&gt;USD 余额]&#10;    C --&gt; D[卖家发起提现&lt;br/&gt;选择出款币种]&#10;    D --&gt; E{出款币 == 记账币?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[直接出账&lt;br/&gt;无汇兑]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[产生汇兑交易&lt;br/&gt;锁定汇率 + 点差]&#10;    G --&gt; H[出款币账户&lt;br/&gt;EUR 余额]&#10;    H --&gt; I[提交清算通道]&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[银行入账&lt;br/&gt;回执与对账]\">graph TD\n    A[买家支付&lt;br/&gt;计价币 USD] --&gt; B{平台账本&lt;br/&gt;记账币?}\n    B --&gt; C[卖家子账户&lt;br/&gt;USD 余额]\n    C --&gt; D[卖家发起提现&lt;br/&gt;选择出款币种]\n    D --&gt; E{出款币 == 记账币?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[直接出账&lt;br/&gt;无汇兑]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[产生汇兑交易&lt;br/&gt;锁定汇率 + 点差]\n    G --&gt; H[出款币账户&lt;br/&gt;EUR 余额]\n    H --&gt; I[提交清算通道]\n    F --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[银行入账&lt;br/&gt;回执与对账]</pre><h2 id=\"汇率来源-加点定价与时间戳\">汇率来源、加点定价与时间戳</h2><p>汇率不是一个数，而是<strong>一个带来源、带时间戳、带方向的报价</strong>。工程上必须能回答：这个汇率谁给的、什么时候的、买还是卖、重算会不会变。</p>\n<p><strong>基准汇率（mid-market rate）</strong> 的权威来源通常是央行或市场中间价。欧洲央行每个工作日约 16:00 CET 发布欧元兑一篮子货币的参考汇率（来源：ECB Euro foreign exchange reference rates <a href=\"https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/policy_and_exchange_rates/euro_reference_exchange_rates/html/index.en.html\">https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/policy_and_exchange_rates/euro_reference_exchange_rates/html/index.en.html</a>）；不涉及欧元时则依赖市场数据源。基准价只用于「定价起点」和「对外披露参考」，<strong>绝不能直接作为成交价</strong>——平台和通道的收入正来自基准价之上的加点。</p>\n<p><strong>加点（spread / markup）</strong> 的工程写法应当是一个定价函数，而不是散落各处的常量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>卖出</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>mid</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>档位</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>币种对</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>通道</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{卖出}} = r_{\\text{mid}} \\times (1 + s), \\qquad s = s_{\\text{档位}} + s_{\\text{币种对}} + s_{\\text{通道}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">卖出</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">档位</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">币种对</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">通道</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><code>s_档位</code>：月结算量越大点差越低，是大卖家的阶梯定价；</li>\n<li><code>s_币种对</code>：主流币对（EUR/USD）点差可低到万分之几，冷门币对（部分非洲、拉美币种）因流动性差可达 1%–3%；</li>\n<li><code>s_通道</code>：本地清算（ACH/SEPA/本地钱包）与 SWIFT 电汇成本结构完全不同，前者接近固定费，后者含中间行逐笔扣费。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>定价必须<strong>冻结在报价上</strong>。一个汇率报价对象至少包含 <code>{pair, side, mid_rate, markup, final_rate, source, quoted_at, expires_at, quote_id}</code>。没有 <code>quoted_at</code> 与 <code>expires_at</code> 的汇率在并发和重试下必然产生争议——两处代码用了同一报价却算出不同结果，只可能因为它们读取了两个不同时刻的汇率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"汇率锁定-报价-有效期与敞口\">汇率锁定：报价、有效期与敞口</h2><p>卖家从「看到预估到账金额」到「确认提现」之间有延迟，这段延迟里的汇率波动由谁承担，就是**汇率锁定（rate lock / FX quote）**要解决的问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>锁定模式</th>\n<th>有效期</th>\n<th>谁承担波动</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实时报价（无锁）</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>卖家</td>\n<td>API 自动化打款、即时结算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短锁</td>\n<td>数分钟至数小时</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>卖家后台点击提现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长锁 / 预约汇率</td>\n<td>24 小时至数天</td>\n<td>平台（需对冲）</td>\n<td>大额提现、卖家主动锁价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远期合约（forward）</td>\n<td>数周至数月</td>\n<td>平台，通过银行对冲</td>\n<td>大卖家财务规划</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>短锁的实现要点是 <strong>TTL 与一次性消费</strong>：报价一旦被用于成交即失效，防止同一报价被复用两次；过期后要么拒绝、要么重新报价并让卖家确认。长锁则把汇率风险从「瞬时」拉长为「持有期敞口」——若锁价后 24 小时内未平仓，汇率反向波动就直接吃掉利润。所以长锁通常配套一个敞口台账（open FX position），把「已锁定未成交」「已成交未平仓」分开计量，超阈值就通过银行或流动性提供商做反向对冲。</p>\n<p>幂等性与锁定必须一起设计。一笔提现请求带 <code>quote_id</code> 重试时，正确行为是<strong>返回首次成交所用的同一汇率</strong>，而不是拿新报价重新算——否则重试会变成一次没有授权的重新定价。这与账本幂等约束同源：以业务身份去重，而非以请求本身去重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"打款币种选择-本地币种-vs-原币种\">打款币种选择：本地币种 vs 原币种</h2><p>卖家最后要回答的问题是：<strong>打到账上的是本地币种，还是原币种？</strong> 这不是偏好问题，而是成本与合规问题，因为币种选择直接决定走哪条通道，通道成本差异可以从几十个基点放大到数个百分点。</p>\n<p><strong>选本地币种（local currency payout）</strong> 意味着平台在出款前完成汇兑，资金以卖家所在国的本地清算网络落地：欧元区走 SEPA / SEPA Instant（EPC 已于 2024 年把 SEPA Instant 单笔上限提高到 10 万欧元，来源：European Payments Council SEPA Instant Credit Transfer <a href=\"https://www.europeanpaymentscouncil.eu/what-we-do/sepa-instant-credit-transfer\">https://www.europeanpaymentscouncil.eu/what-we-do/sepa-instant-credit-transfer</a>），英国走 Faster Payments，印度走 UPI，巴西走 PIX，中国香港走 FPS。这条路优势是<strong>末端廉价且快</strong>：本地清算几乎不含中间行，到账从秒级到当日，收款方也不会被逐笔扣费。</p>\n<p><strong>选原币种（cross-currency / SWIFT 电汇）</strong> 意味着资金以美元、欧元等主要货币走 SWIFT 网络，由收款行在其端完成兑付。代价是三层不确定：中间行可能逐笔扣费（收款人实际到账少于汇出额）、路径不可预测、到账以工作日计。SWIFT 正推进 MT 报文到 ISO 20022 的迁移，以提升跨境数据透明度与直通率（来源：SWIFT ISO 20022 migration <a href=\"https://www.swift.com/standards/iso-20022/iso-20022-migration\">https://www.swift.com/standards/iso-20022/iso-20022-migration</a>），但中间行扣费这一结构性成本不会因报文升级而消失。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>本地币种出款</th>\n<th>原币种 SWIFT 出款</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>汇兑发生地</td>\n<td>平台侧（出款前）</td>\n<td>收款行侧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末端成本</td>\n<td>低（本地清算费）</td>\n<td>高（含中间行扣费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到账速度</td>\n<td>秒级–当日</td>\n<td>1–5 个工作日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率透明度</td>\n<td>高（平台披露加点）</td>\n<td>低（收款行加价不可见）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家到账确定性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（扣费后到账）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择逻辑可收敛成一条决策链：<strong>优先本地币种；只有当卖家要求持有主要货币（如跨境卖家需美元采购）、本地通道不支持该币种/该国、或单笔金额低于本地通道经济门槛时，才退化到原币种电汇</strong>。行业主流做法与此一致：Wise、Airwallex、Payoneer 一类跨境收款服务主打「按本地币种入账、平台侧完成汇兑」，以中间市场汇率加公开费率披露成本（来源：Wise pricing <a href=\"https://wise.com/pricing\">https://wise.com/pricing</a>）；亚马逊的货币转换服务让卖家按商城本地币种收款、由平台换算并收取一定比例点差（来源：Amazon 卖家定价与货币转换说明 <a href=\"https://sell.amazon.com/pricing\">https://sell.amazon.com/pricing</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监管与披露义务\">监管与披露义务</h2><p>多币种打款的成本若不被披露，就变成卖家无法比价的隐性扣费，这正是监管近年持续收紧的方向。</p>\n<p>欧盟 <strong>Cross-Border Payments Regulation (EU) 2021/1230</strong> 取代了原 924/2009 条例，要求跨境欧元支付与相关货币转换服务的收费不得高于同等的境内支付，并强制在交易前披露货币转换的全部费用、适用汇率及其与央行参考汇率的比较（来源：EUR-Lex Regulation (EU) 2021/1230 <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2021/1230/oj\">https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2021/1230/oj</a>）。工程上这意味着：<strong>报价接口必须返回「本次换算的加点」与「参考汇率」两个可展示字段</strong>；前端展示、对账单、通知三处必须用同一份数据源，否则披露就会与实际扣费不一致。</p>\n<p>G20 跨境支付路线图由国际清算银行（BIS）的支付与市场基础设施委员会（CPMI）推进，为零售跨境支付设定了到 2027 年的目标，包括降低平均成本、提升到账速度与全链路透明度（来源：BIS CPMI, G20 cross-border payments roadmap <a href=\"https://www.bis.org/cpmi/publ/d193.htm\">https://www.bis.org/cpmi/publ/d193.htm</a>）；世界银行 Remittance Prices Worldwide 数据库长期跟踪全球汇款成本，是比价与基准的公开数据源（来源：World Bank Remittance Prices Worldwide <a href=\"https://remittanceprices.worldbank.org/\">https://remittanceprices.worldbank.org/</a>）。对平台而言，这条监管线最实际的落地物是<strong>一份可导出的打款成本对账单</strong>：每笔出款列出汇出金额、所用汇率、基准汇率、点差、通道费、中间行扣费与最终到账金额，让卖家自行核算真实成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"舍入-汇兑损益与对账衔接\">舍入、汇兑损益与对账衔接</h2><p>多币种系统里最常见的对账差额来源不是黑客，而是<strong>舍入</strong>。三步必须写成确定性规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>同币种内不换算</strong>：只有跨币种才引入汇率，避免无谓精度损失；</li>\n<li><strong>单次换算、单次舍入</strong>：一笔汇兑交易内只做一次舍入，禁止「先换 USD 再换 EUR」的两段式路径；</li>\n<li><strong>差额归属明确</strong>：舍入产生的正负零点几个最小单位，统一归入专用舍入损益账户，而不是让它消失或散落到卖家余额。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mtext> </mtext><mtext>minor unit</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\cdot r = b + \\delta, \\qquad |\\delta| \\le \\tfrac{1}{2}\\,\\text{minor unit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">minor unit</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 即舍入差额，必须显式记账。若放任 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 不进账本，日终对账时「汇款总额 × 汇率」与「实际入账总额」必然对不上，且该差额随出款笔数线性累积，最终变成一笔无法解释的悬挂金额。</p>\n<p>汇兑损益应按出款批次归集：锁价日到平仓日之间的汇率变动，是平台承担的持有期损益；报价加点带来的收入，是平台赚取的价差收入。两者必须分开列示——前者是风险敞口的结果，后者是定价策略的结果，混在一起就无法判断定价是否覆盖了风险。这也自然接到核对与异常处理：出款回执、银行对账单与账本三方比对时，汇兑差额需要能直接定位到具体一笔汇兑交易，而不是在总额层面做人工猜测，见 <a href=\"../reconciliation-exception-ops/\">对账与异常处理</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三层币种必须分开</strong>：计价币只是展示，记账币是账本事实，出款币触发一次显式汇兑；每个（账户 × 币种）独立成户。</li>\n<li><strong>汇率是带来源与时间戳的报价</strong>：<code>{pair, side, mid_rate, markup, final_rate, source, quoted_at, expires_at, quote_id}</code> 缺一不可，成交必须冻结在报价上。</li>\n<li><strong>锁定的本质是分配波动风险</strong>：短锁靠 TTL 与一次性消费，长锁必须配套敞口台账与对冲，锁价后重试必须重放首次汇率。</li>\n<li><strong>打款币种决定通道成本</strong>：默认选本地币种（SEPA/UPI/PIX/FPS 一路到底），仅在卖家需持有主要货币、本地通道不支持或金额过小时退化到 SWIFT 电汇。</li>\n<li><strong>披露是合规义务</strong>：EU 2021/1230 要求披露加点与参考汇率比对，G20 路线图设定了 2027 年的成本与透明度目标。</li>\n<li><strong>舍入与汇兑损益必须显式入账</strong>：单次换算、单次舍入，差额进专用损益账户；价差收入与持有期损益分开列示。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多币种结算、汇率锁定与打款币种选择","id":"多币种结算-汇率锁定与打款币种选择"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：计价币、记账币、出款币三层模型","id":"核心概念-计价币-记账币-出款币三层模型"},{"level":2,"text":"汇率来源、加点定价与时间戳","id":"汇率来源-加点定价与时间戳"},{"level":2,"text":"汇率锁定：报价、有效期与敞口","id":"汇率锁定-报价-有效期与敞口"},{"level":2,"text":"打款币种选择：本地币种 vs 原币种","id":"打款币种选择-本地币种-vs-原币种"},{"level":2,"text":"监管与披露义务","id":"监管与披露义务"},{"level":2,"text":"舍入、汇兑损益与对账衔接","id":"舍入-汇兑损益与对账衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"卖家应付账款、可打款余额与资金占用建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-payout-global-disbursement-remittance-ops/payable-settlement-model/payable-balance-ledger"},"next":{"title":"打款周期、资金留存与结算日历设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-payout-global-disbursement-remittance-ops/payable-settlement-model/payout-cycle-hold-calendar"}}